+  - `test_persist_failure_reports_no_error_event_and_done_with_persisted_false` verifying `[e.type for e in events][-1] == EventType.DONE`, `done.data["persisted"] is False`, `done.data["message_id"] is None`, `done.data["created_at"]` is present, and no `error` event exists.
+  - `test_stream_emits_conversation_first_and_done_last` and `test_non_stream_chat_and_background_summary` in `test_chat_api.py`.
+
+---
